9. Open Questions
    ...

10. Additional Considerations
    - SHOULD monitor user feedback and utilize it to continuously improve the chatbot's performance and user satisfaction.
    - MAY implement machine learning algorithms to adapt and learn from user interactions, improving the chatbot's ability to understand and respond to queries effectively.
    - SHOULD provide personalization options, allowing users to customize their chatbot experience by adjusting settings, such as language options, tone of voice, and preferences for the types of information they want to receive.

